# Only backend source and its build configuration are uploaded to Cloud Build.
**
!cloudbuild.yaml
!kakoride/
!kakoride/api/
!kakoride/api/**
kakoride/api/.env*
kakoride/api/.data/**
kakoride/api/.test-tmp/**
kakoride/api/.pytest_cache/**
kakoride/api/**/__pycache__/**
kakoride/api/**/*.pyc
kakoride/api/tests/**
kakoride/api/.venv/**
